From c06bea26054239801a023f5538b61e1fc37a379c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 15:31:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] AI_AB_TEST Economy 0046: a late strike's PREP keeps its
 income and saves for its BUILDUP

bullyabort22 15286C56 (ab-103bd11): Songhai's late strike stayed in PREP T1-T148. The
BUILDUP condition (Personality's IsStrikeEconomyReady) waits for half the upgrade bill saved
(300), but the treasury peaked at 283 (T60) and drained to 0 (T100). Purchases weren't the
cause (GoldBreakdown_Log); unit upkeep was. The strike list built 6 Horsemen and 3 Archers in
PREP (T42-T88): units 11 -> 18, upkeep 13 -> 30 a turn, net -7 to -12.
- The list (0041): in a late strike's PREP, a combat item waits while net gold is under +2
  a turn, and the list goes on to its economy items (logged "LIST HOLD: net gold N").
- New CvPlayer::IsLateStrikePrepSaving: a late strike's PREP with K cities and the upgrade
  tech in reach, below iEconomyGoldTarget. Its treasury is kept like BUILDUP's (no
  hurries/purchases, no tiles) until the target is saved. The beeline and the pre-build
  still wait for BUILDUP (IsLateStrikeSaving is unchanged).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01G2NZj2nf4FeZTEHWjvnhhA
---
 CvGameCoreDLL_Expansion2/CvEconomicAI.cpp |  8 +++----
 CvGameCoreDLL_Expansion2/CvPlayer.cpp     | 29 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 CvGameCoreDLL_Expansion2/CvPlayer.h       |  1 +
 3 files changed, 34 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/CvGameCoreDLL_Expansion2/CvEconomicAI.cpp b/CvGameCoreDLL_Expansion2/CvEconomicAI.cpp
